{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果於本周正式發佈搭載OLED顯示屏和A20 Pro晶片的新一代iPad mini（2026），該產品將於11月6日開始向首批消費者發貨。在正式開售前，一台新機已經現身Geekbench 7數據庫，其性能表現也隨之曝光。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584420.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.809328+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:43:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"8b7fc2bd01deff738ab8435d0bb8e15e8cb30c883dc106700bde88742d90672b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}